1
00:00:00,123 --> 00:00:03,623
(Sheldon:)I did not mean to gaze upon you
as you comb your hair.

2
00:00:04,961 --> 00:00:06,211
(Lalita:)I'm sorry?

3
00:00:06,379 --> 00:00:09,509
(Sheldon:)You are the living embodiment
of the beautiful Princess Panchali.

4
00:00:10,049 --> 00:00:13,139
Oh, no kidding. Who is that?

5
00:00:13,303 --> 00:00:15,893
(Sheldon:)A beloved character
from an Indian folktale.

6
00:00:16,139 --> 00:00:17,679
(Dr Koothrappali:)Oh.

7
00:00:17,932 --> 00:00:20,852
(Lalita:)Us Indian
or "come to our casino" Indian?

8
00:00:22,812 --> 00:00:24,482
- You Indian.
- Oh.

9
00:00:24,814 --> 00:00:26,904
(Sheldon:)The resemblance is remarkable.

10
00:00:27,066 --> 00:00:30,486
(Sheldon:)I can practically smell the lotus blossoms
woven into your ebony hair.

11
00:00:30,862 --> 00:00:32,492
Well, thanks.

12
00:00:32,655 --> 00:00:34,995
(Lalita:)I imagine you smell very nice too.

13
00:00:35,325 --> 00:00:38,995
(Sheldon:)I shower twice a day
and wash my hands as often as I can.

14
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:41,329
Really? So do I.

15
00:00:41,497 --> 00:00:44,497
(Raj:)But you're a dentist, he's nuts.

16
00:00:45,543 --> 00:00:47,753
(Lalita:)Don't be insulting, Rajesh.

17
00:00:47,921 --> 00:00:51,711
(Lalita:)So, Sheldon, tell me more about
this princess you say I look like.

18
00:00:51,883 --> 00:00:55,933
(Sheldon:)It was said that the gods
fashioned her eyes out of the stars...

19
00:00:56,095 --> 00:01:00,095
(Sheldon:)...and that roses were ashamed to bloom
in the presence of her ruby lips.

